'''Shadow warriors''' are monsters that can be found in the dungeon beneath the [[Legends' Guild]]. They are not considered [[undead]], so the [[salve amulet]] has no effect on them, and they are one of few monsters that are hidden on the player's [[minimap]]. 

After completion of [[Legends' Quest]], shadow warriors are a possible [[Slayer task]] from [[Chaeldar]] and [[Vannaka]].

Although they do not have the undead or [[spectral]] [[attribute]]s, they are still undead according to the 36th [[Postbag from the Hedge]], as [[Radimus Erkle]] says that the shadow warriors are resurrected with [[necromancy]].{{CitePostbag|issue=36|author=Radimus Erkle|letter=3|name=}} They also wear spectral plate armour.{{CiteNPC|npc=Slayer Master|quote=Shadow Warriors are dark and mysterious. They wear spectral plate armour, so crush weapons and magic will give them trouble. |loc=|notes=|name=}}

